  "prefLabel": "Lab 204.10 Decision on Motion for Reconsideration, Rehearing, or Clarification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 204.10 Decision on Motion for Reconsideration, Rehearing, or Clarification. The department shall grant or deny the request for reconsideration, rehearing, or clarification within 10 days of the filing of the motion where no response or objection has been filed. The department shall grant or deny the motion within 10 days of receipt of a response or objection filed in accordance with Lab 204.09(c).\n\nSource. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab200.html"
